1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:03,000
Japan Football Federation

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:04,920
Champions

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,090
The First National Youth Tournament in France

4
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:11,760
Japan Youth National Team Members

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:16,970
Now they have returned home and are starting their new school terms.

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,270
Nankatsu City, Nankatsu Middle School

7
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:22,100
And here is Nankatsu Middle School...

8
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:25,770
This way! Run further!

9
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,900
Okay.

10
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:31,030
Be careful. You can't win the first-year autumn tournament this way!

11
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,280
The third-years graduated.

12
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,280
And a new football team

13
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:39,500
for Nankatsu Middle School football, from first and second years,

14
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:43,210
has started morning training for the first-year autumn tournament.

15
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:47,380
I'm happy that Tsubasa stayed as a coach.

16
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,670
But there's a big difference between him and these third-years.

17
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,550
You're right.

18
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:55,760
Yamazaki, you could have controlled it better.

19
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,850
Tsubasa Senpai.

20
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,980
I have to tell him today.

21
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:19,240
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

22
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:38,810
Episode 37
Confession

23
00:02:33,970 --> 00:02:35,010
Hello!

24
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:36,220
Good morning.

25
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:39,390
Ishizaki, I saw you on television. You were amazing!

26
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:45,900
What a headline. Triple national champion and now world number one. Incredible!

27
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:48,820
You're embarrassing me!

28
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:51,240
I think it's all thanks to Tsubasa.

29
00:02:51,490 --> 00:02:52,450
What?

30
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:55,540
Idiot! I worked hard too!

31
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:57,250
Hello, Ishizaki!

32
00:02:57,950 --> 00:03:00,160
Oh, Izawa and his gang.

33
00:03:00,420 --> 00:03:05,250
Man, we just got back from France and the new year is around the corner.

34
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:09,010
No more football, we have to take the entrance exams.

35
00:03:09,090 --> 00:03:10,050
Yes.

36
00:03:10,130 --> 00:03:11,760
Kizugi, where do you want to go?

37
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:14,640
I want to go to Nankatsu Public High School.

38
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:18,520
Me too. They have a great football team.

39
00:03:18,770 --> 00:03:21,690
Come on, you all want to go to Nankatsu.

40
00:03:22,230 --> 00:03:27,280
I want to too, but my grades are terrible.

41
00:03:27,530 --> 00:03:30,860
Then we'll help you study today.

42
00:03:30,950 --> 00:03:34,280
Yes. We can teach you anything you don't understand.

43
00:03:34,450 --> 00:03:36,410
Swear!

44
00:03:36,490 --> 00:03:40,370
Great, I'm really lucky to have such good teammates.

45
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:47,630
What's wrong? Come on, run, run!

46
00:03:48,210 --> 00:03:50,670
Oh, Tsubasa is in morning training.

47
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:54,930
I envy him. He's good at football and doesn't need to study for the entrance exam.

48
00:03:55,390 --> 00:03:59,390
Idiot! Tsubasa's situation is worse than ours.

49
00:03:59,930 --> 00:04:01,930
He wants to go to Brazil.

50
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:05,520
Finally, Tsubasa's dream is coming true.

51
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,110
Yes.

52
00:04:07,730 --> 00:04:09,320
Hey, Tsubasa!

53
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,990
Take care of the lower grades, okay?

54
00:04:12,070 --> 00:04:13,950
See you in class later.

55
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,120
Okay!

56
00:04:17,030 --> 00:04:20,200
Alright, this morning's training is over.

57
00:04:20,370 --> 00:04:21,200
Thank you.

58
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,840
Good luck, Kumi. You can do it.

59
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,720
You can do it. Go on!

60
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,180
Tsubasa Senpai.

61
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:44,100
I love you, Tsubasa Senpai.

62
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,520
What!?

63
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:51,110
I've liked you since I came to this school.

64
00:04:51,570 --> 00:04:54,780
You were so focused on football.

65
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:59,910
And as team manager, I thought I was just a nuisance.

66
00:05:00,410 --> 00:05:03,120
That's why I kept quiet.

67
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:08,790
Until now, I really love you.

68
00:05:10,130 --> 00:05:11,210
Kumi-chan.

69
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:17,890
But... it's impossible, isn't it?

70
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:20,970
You love someone else, don't you?

71
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:21,890
Huh!?

72
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:25,560
Please. Answer my question.

73
00:05:27,690 --> 00:05:30,900
Is there someone you love?

74
00:05:32,570 --> 00:05:33,400
Yes.

75
00:05:33,860 --> 00:05:36,900
And it's Nakazawa Sanae Senpai, isn't it?

76
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:43,910
Yes.

77
00:05:46,210 --> 00:05:47,580
I'm glad.

78
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,540
Tsubasa Senpai!

79
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:02,970
Hey, Tsubasa, you're late.

80
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,970
Good morning, Tsubasa-kun.

81
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,560
Good morning.

82
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:11,310
Did everyone have a good summer vacation?

83
00:06:11,690 --> 00:06:14,730
Alright, it's roll call time.

84
00:06:16,030 --> 00:06:17,400
Sorry.

85
00:06:18,110 --> 00:06:22,830
Tsubasa Senpai, do me a favor.

86
00:06:23,490 --> 00:06:24,330
A favor?

87
00:06:24,790 --> 00:06:28,250
Please tell Sanae Senpai that you love her.

88
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:31,830
I care about you a lot.

89
00:06:32,210 --> 00:06:35,840
But I realized that you two truly love each other.

90
00:06:36,590 --> 00:06:41,090
So now, I want to truly support both of you.

91
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:44,350
I'm not the only one saying this.

92
00:06:44,890 --> 00:06:48,600
So, Tsubasa Senpai, please tell Sanae Senpai...

93
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:50,560
Tell her you really love her.

94
00:06:51,650 --> 00:06:54,360
Oh, is Sugimoto-san absent today?

95
00:06:55,110 --> 00:06:58,860
Please, I know Sanae Senpai is waiting.

96
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,360
Because...

97
00:07:02,410 --> 00:07:06,910
Sanae Senpai loves you and the way you play football.

98
00:07:08,250 --> 00:07:10,620
She doesn't want to get in your way.

99
00:07:10,710 --> 00:07:12,710
She hides her feelings.

100
00:07:13,170 --> 00:07:16,880
That's why you have to make the first move.

101
00:07:17,550 --> 00:07:20,760
But I'm happy I could tell you today.

102
00:07:21,050 --> 00:07:27,640
I really needed to release the feelings I've kept hidden in my mind towards you for a long time.

103
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:35,650
Library

104
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:35,650
What a surprise!

105
00:07:35,820 --> 00:07:38,400
Interesting to see you here, Ishizaki-kun.

106
00:07:38,650 --> 00:07:44,410
Shut up. I'm studying hard to get into Nankatsu High School.

107
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:47,990
I can't believe it. If Ishizaki-kun is studying, it must be raining.

108
00:07:48,290 --> 00:07:51,000
I didn't bring an umbrella today.

109
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:53,920
Oh, rain clouds are gathering.

110
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,170
Hey, hey.

111
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:57,050
By the way, where's Tsubasa-kun?

112
00:07:57,380 --> 00:08:00,300
Tsubasa was coaching the lower grades.

113
00:08:00,590 --> 00:08:04,300
Is that so? Tsubasa-kun has no entrance exam at all.

114
00:08:06,930 --> 00:08:08,180
Tsubasa-kun.

115
00:08:10,930 --> 00:08:12,810
You're Nakazawa Sanae, aren't you?

116
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:14,310
Kanda-kun!

117
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,810
Who do you think you are?

118
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:18,270
This doesn't concern you.

119
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,400
What!?

120
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:21,440
Ishizaki-kun, it's okay.

121
00:08:21,530 --> 00:08:22,950
Manager!

122
00:08:27,830 --> 00:08:29,450
I'm returning this to you.

123
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:32,210
Oh, this...

124
00:08:35,210 --> 00:08:36,880
There was no need for this.

125
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:39,920
But thank you.

126
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:43,590
Excuse me...

127
00:08:45,470 --> 00:08:46,840
I... love you.

128
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:53,100
Alright, break time.

129
00:08:56,650 --> 00:08:58,860
Where's the manager?

130
00:08:59,150 --> 00:09:01,230
I haven't seen her today.

131
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,610
Oh.

132
00:09:06,110 --> 00:09:07,570
Oh, she's back.

133
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:09,370
Sanae, what was it about?

134
00:09:10,490 --> 00:09:11,870
Tell us, Sanae.

135
00:09:12,660 --> 00:09:16,120
He wanted to go out with me.

136
00:09:16,370 --> 00:09:17,630
What?

137
00:09:17,710 --> 00:09:19,880
So... what did you say?

138
00:09:20,550 --> 00:09:23,340
I said I love someone else.

139
00:09:23,420 --> 00:09:25,590
Heh, she finally confessed.

140
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,930
Does she mean Tsubasa-kun?

141
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,890
I'm not giving up.

142
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:32,890
What!?

143
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:37,520
Hey, wait.

144
00:09:38,730 --> 00:09:40,650
Hey, she rejected you.

145
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:43,360
What don't you understand?

146
00:09:43,530 --> 00:09:46,490
Be a man and give up.

147
00:09:46,570 --> 00:09:47,910
Ishizaki-kun.

148
00:09:48,950 --> 00:09:49,910
Shut up.

149
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:54,620
If you hang around the manager, I won't have any mercy on you, understand?

150
00:09:55,750 --> 00:09:58,040
Shut up! I told you to shut up!

151
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,130
Ishizaki!

152
00:09:59,210 --> 00:10:00,630
Ishizaki-kun!

153
00:10:00,710 --> 00:10:02,340
Ka- Kanda-kun!

154
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:03,420
Scumbag...

155
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,300
You want a fight?

156
00:10:05,380 --> 00:10:06,550
Finish this, Ishizaki.

157
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:10,390
You may have graduated, but you're still a member of Nankatsu football.

158
00:10:10,470 --> 00:10:11,350
The first and second years

159
00:10:11,430 --> 00:10:14,140
are on the threshold of the first-year autumn tournament.

160
00:10:14,220 --> 00:10:18,060
If you do something stupid, they might not be able to participate in the tournament.

161
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:22,320
Coward...

162
00:10:22,610 --> 00:10:23,520
What!?

163
00:10:23,610 --> 00:10:25,320
Ishizaki, calm down.

164
00:10:27,150 --> 00:10:30,280
I'm sorry I caused you trouble, Ishizaki-kun.

165
00:10:30,370 --> 00:10:32,080
No, don't worry.

166
00:10:32,830 --> 00:10:34,290
Kanda Koshi.

167
00:10:34,370 --> 00:10:40,290
He's in my class and his family has a private boxing club.

168
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:42,090
Oh, I remember!

169
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:45,380
Kanda's club is on Third Street.

170
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:50,470
He's been boxing since childhood, so now he's almost professional.

171
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:52,430
You're lucky, Ishizaki.

172
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:56,020
If you had fought then, you definitely would have been knocked out.

173
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:59,350
Idiot. It would never happen to me.

174
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:03,770
I gave up the fight for the football team.

175
00:11:03,900 --> 00:11:05,360
Hey, guys.

176
00:11:05,650 --> 00:11:06,940
Oh, Tsubasa.

177
00:11:07,490 --> 00:11:08,700
Going home?

178
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:09,700
Yes.

179
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:12,450
What's wrong, Ishizaki-kun? You look sad.

180
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:14,990
No- nothing happened.

181
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:17,450
Oh, I'm going this way.

182
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:18,370
What?

183
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:20,000
I'm going this way too.

184
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:21,710
Me too.

185
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:23,000
See you later, Sanae.

186
00:11:24,290 --> 00:11:27,130
Oh, see you later, Tsubasa.

187
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:29,010
You...

188
00:11:30,010 --> 00:11:33,550
Don't forget to walk the manager home.

189
00:11:42,350 --> 00:11:45,270
How are the first and second years?

190
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:49,820
Actually, they still have a long way to go.

191
00:11:50,110 --> 00:11:54,820
I thought you would finally take a breather when you returned from Europe.

192
00:11:54,910 --> 00:11:58,160
But in the end, for you, everything is football, isn't it?

193
00:11:58,660 --> 00:12:02,870
Well, since I intend to make a living with football...

194
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:06,420
I guess football will occupy my entire life.

195
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:07,460
Yes.

196
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:10,510
I'm happy, Tsubasa-kun.

197
00:12:10,590 --> 00:12:12,590
You saw Roberto in France.

198
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:16,510
And Brazil... your dream is finally coming true.

199
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,640
Yes.

200
00:12:18,310 --> 00:12:21,890
We only have 6 months left to spend time together.

201
00:12:22,690 --> 00:12:23,520
Yes.

202
00:12:24,020 --> 00:12:28,440
Please tell Sanae Senpai that you love her.

203
00:12:29,190 --> 00:12:30,320
Tsubasa-kun.

204
00:12:32,570 --> 00:12:38,240
Just now, Ishizaki-kun was upset because of me.

205
00:12:38,580 --> 00:12:39,410
What?

206
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:44,040
So that's what it was.

207
00:12:44,370 --> 00:12:48,800
I'm glad Ishizaki-kun controlled himself for the football team.

208
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:51,170
And if he hadn't, there would have been a big fight.

209
00:12:52,090 --> 00:12:54,680
I hate bullies.

210
00:12:55,260 --> 00:12:57,430
So I said it directly.

211
00:12:58,470 --> 00:13:01,430
I love someone else.

212
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,570
Sanae-chan.

213
00:13:20,490 --> 00:13:21,330
I...

214
00:13:26,710 --> 00:13:28,840
Hey, Tsubasa!

215
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,290
What great timing.

216
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:33,460
I was just heading to your house.

217
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:34,550
Carlos.

218
00:13:34,630 --> 00:13:37,090
Come on, let's study some more Portuguese today.

219
00:13:37,590 --> 00:13:40,300
Alright, Tsubasa-kun. See you later.

220
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:43,140
Thanks for walking me home. See you tomorrow.

221
00:13:43,470 --> 00:13:45,270
Okay. Goodbye.

222
00:13:47,310 --> 00:13:51,360
What? Did I interrupt something?

223
00:13:51,690 --> 00:13:55,360
No, Carlos. Let's go home and study.

224
00:13:55,450 --> 00:13:56,820
Okay!

225
00:13:57,450 --> 00:13:59,370
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

226
00:14:01,610 --> 00:14:03,980
Nankatsu Managers

227
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,610
Go! Cut him off!

228
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,660
Hurry up, guys!

229
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:09,740
Try harder!

230
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:11,370
Kumi-chan!

231
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:14,200
Oh, Tsubasa Senpai, good morning.

232
00:14:14,290 --> 00:14:15,120
Good morning.

233
00:14:18,210 --> 00:14:24,550
I cried all night and now I feel better.

234
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:28,180
I joined the football team to be closer to you...

235
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:32,050
But through managing, I fell in love with football.

236
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:36,350
So I want to continue managing for the football team.

237
00:14:36,730 --> 00:14:38,890
Okay. Thanks, Kumi-chan.

238
00:14:39,310 --> 00:14:44,020
Instead, I want you to keep the promise you made to me.

239
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:47,240
Alright, get ready, guys!

240
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,280
Because of you, Tsubasa Senpai!

241
00:14:49,610 --> 00:14:51,070
Mark tighter!

242
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:53,780
Use your hips more for long shots!

243
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:56,540
Don't hold the ball too much! Move it around!

244
00:15:03,290 --> 00:15:05,050
Are you Ozora Tsubasa?

245
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:08,470
What did you just say?

246
00:15:08,590 --> 00:15:12,300
I also declared my love for Nakazawa Sanae.

247
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,810
If you don't want to lose her, let's have a match.

248
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,520
A match?

249
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:22,480
One-on-one duel, man to man.

250
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:25,770
You choose the type.

251
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:28,820
Of course, it could even be your football specialty.

252
00:15:29,490 --> 00:15:32,360
The manager's feelings are the manager's feelings.

253
00:15:32,570 --> 00:15:34,950
They're not things we can compete over.

254
00:15:36,330 --> 00:15:38,200
What? Are you running away?

255
00:15:39,370 --> 00:15:42,580
You may have conquered Japan with your football...

256
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:46,550
...but you're not man enough to protect a woman.

257
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,710
What!?

258
00:15:48,050 --> 00:15:53,180
Or maybe you don't really love Nakazawa Sanae.

259
00:15:58,850 --> 00:16:00,480
That's enough for today.

260
00:16:00,810 --> 00:16:02,690
Stand up, salute!

261
00:16:04,230 --> 00:16:06,270
Tsubasa. What are you doing?

262
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,070
Are you going to football training today?

263
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:11,240
No, I have something else to do.

264
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:15,870
Really? I'm going to study in the library again today.

265
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:19,370
Don't be sad, we're with you there.

266
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:20,830
Let's go.

267
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:26,090
You're right. I never thought of it.

268
00:16:25,130 --> 00:16:26,630
Library

269
00:16:26,130 --> 00:16:29,880
Really? I never thought of it.

270
00:16:35,090 --> 00:16:36,800
What's the matter, Sanae?

271
00:16:37,010 --> 00:16:38,760
Sorry, I...

272
00:16:37,430 --> 00:16:40,310
Library

273
00:16:38,810 --> 00:16:40,310
What? Sanae!

274
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:44,850
Nankatsu Middle School Boxing Team

275
00:16:51,030 --> 00:16:54,450
Ozora Tsubasa, you're very brave.

276
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:57,070
You chose to fight me in the ring.

277
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:59,080
A fight?

278
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:00,870
Manager!

279
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:02,250
Tsubasa-kun!

280
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:06,170
Yes, Nakazawa Sanae. We'll fight and you're the prize.

281
00:17:07,630 --> 00:17:09,670
I'm disgusted by you!

282
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:13,510
It may be like this now, but I'll make you fall in love with me.

283
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,140
Oh, by the way, where's the manager today?

284
00:17:18,390 --> 00:17:19,430
I don't know.

285
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:21,930
She said she had to go and went somewhere.

286
00:17:22,730 --> 00:17:24,180
Oh, you're here.

287
00:17:24,980 --> 00:17:27,560
Guys, have you seen Tsubasa!?

288
00:17:27,650 --> 00:17:28,730
Coach.

289
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:30,980
Tsubasa said something came up for him.

290
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:33,860
Do you know anything about it?

291
00:17:33,030 --> 00:17:34,570
Resignation Letter from Ozora Tsubasa

292
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:37,660
R- Resignation letter!?

293
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:40,580
I won't give Nakazawa Sanae to you.

294
00:17:40,950 --> 00:17:42,450
If I have to take her by force, I will.

295
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:43,540
Wait!

296
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,040
Don't do this, Tsubasa-kun.

297
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:50,340
Don't sacrifice your football for me!

298
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:53,050
If you do this, Nankatsu football...

299
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:55,090
I've already submitted my resignation letter.

300
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:56,430
What!?

301
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,970
Stop trying to be cool.

302
00:18:01,350 --> 00:18:02,470
Sanae-chan!

303
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:05,850
Let's see if you really have courage.

304
00:18:06,190 --> 00:18:08,190
Alright, step forward!

305
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:13,230
This is really Tsubasa's handwriting.

306
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:15,110
What's going on?

307
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:23,240
Hey, what happened?

308
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:25,750
Stop this! Enough!

309
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:28,460
Tsubasa-kun, get out of there immediately!

310
00:18:28,670 --> 00:18:31,630
Tsubasa-kun, you can't do this!

311
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:34,550
Football is everything to you, Tsubasa-kun.

312
00:18:34,670 --> 00:18:36,260
You can't get injured for something like this!

313
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:43,260
I hit him many times and he's still standing!?

314
00:18:43,810 --> 00:18:47,180
Get out of there now and go back to the football field.

315
00:18:47,810 --> 00:18:49,940
Please, Tsubasa-kun.

316
00:18:50,650 --> 00:18:54,320
Go, go, Tsubasa!

317
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:58,070
Fight, fight, Tsubasa!

318
00:18:58,490 --> 00:19:01,160
Tsubasa-kun! Good luck!

319
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:03,740
Take a towel.

320
00:19:04,030 --> 00:19:07,910
Wipe your sweat. You still want to continue, don't you?

321
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:13,290
Get well soon, okay?

322
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:19,050
Please... finish this.

323
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:23,350
Your girlfriend is trembling and you still haven't landed a single punch.

324
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:26,520
You're not fit for fighting at all.

325
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:36,070
Nakazawa Sanae is mine!

326
00:19:50,370 --> 00:19:53,880
So this is... the kick that conquered the world.

327
00:19:56,250 --> 00:19:59,260
A- Are you okay, Kanda?

328
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:03,640
Idiot, how can I be okay after seeing this?

329
00:20:04,090 --> 00:20:05,930
That kick that won the triple national championship...

330
00:20:06,010 --> 00:20:09,520
No, it became world number one, it's no joke.

331
00:20:09,770 --> 00:20:13,730
No wonder Nakazawa Sanae is locked onto you.

332
00:20:14,810 --> 00:20:15,860
Kanda.

333
00:20:16,570 --> 00:20:18,030
I lost!

334
00:20:20,110 --> 00:20:21,740
There he is. Tsubasa!

335
00:20:21,860 --> 00:20:23,780
Sanae, are you okay?

336
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:28,660
How dare you fight at school?

337
00:20:29,290 --> 00:20:31,620
No, it's not like that.

338
00:20:31,710 --> 00:20:35,040
Ozora Tsubasa was helping me with training.

339
00:20:35,630 --> 00:20:37,840
I have a match coming up.

340
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:40,920
Oh, this is his resignation letter, right?

341
00:20:41,170 --> 00:20:42,300
This, yes...

342
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:45,090
I forged this as a fake.

343
00:20:45,140 --> 00:20:46,010
What?

344
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:48,680
It was just a little prank.

345
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:53,310
Hey, you.

346
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:58,190
With these, I plan to become world number one.

347
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:09,740
Tsubasa-kun.

348
00:21:10,490 --> 00:21:11,290
Thank you.

349
00:21:11,870 --> 00:21:14,210
Why did you do this?

350
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:22,590
Why...

351
00:21:24,130 --> 00:21:26,090
Why do you want to do something like this?

352
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:34,480
When I graduate from middle school, I want to go to Brazil.

353
00:21:34,980 --> 00:21:37,020
So I can become a professional footballer.

354
00:21:37,770 --> 00:21:42,530
I won't return to Japan until I become a real professional.

355
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:44,110
So...

356
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:47,990
I can't ask you to wait until then.

357
00:21:49,580 --> 00:21:53,950
And I can't ask you to come with me either.

358
00:21:55,370 --> 00:21:57,330
But I...

359
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:00,670
I love you.

360
00:23:46,500 --> 00:23:50,040
Next Episode: Start of a New Era!